<title>UK: TELEWEST DETAILS Q2 NET NEW CUSTOMERS.</title>
<headline>TELEWEST DETAILS Q2 NET NEW CUSTOMERS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British cable TV company Telewest Communications Plc on Thursday detailed its net new customer in the second quarter of 1997 as follows:</p>
<p>				Q2 1997	 VERSUS	Q2 1996</p>
<p> Cable TV customers	18,235			  14,172</p>
<p> Residential telephony   50,931			  33,485</p>
<p> Business telephony	 1,668			   1,619</p>
<p>Following are operating figures as at June 30, 1997 versus the same period in 1996:</p>
<p>CABLE TELEVISION</p>
<p>  Customers		 559,963			 426,010</p>
<p>  Penetration		  22.0 percent		  21.1</p>
<p>  Churn rate		   32.2 percent		  36.4</p>
<p>  Revenue per subscriber   23.37 stg			n/a</p>
<p>RESIDENTIAL TELEPHONY</p>
<p>  Customers		 720,508			 498,646</p>
<p>  Penetration		  28.9 percent		  26.4</p>
<p>  Churn rate		   19.2 percent		  20.2</p>
<p>  Avg revenue per line     19.09 stg			n/a</p>
<p>BUSINESS TELEPHONY</p>
<p>  Customers		  23,173			  17,365</p>
<p>  Churn rate		   15.7 percent		  12.5</p>
<p>  Avg revenue per line     44.67			    n/a</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
</text>
